7. Let the applicant Shyamu alias Shyam be released on bail in the aforesaid Case Crime No.105 of 2023, under sections 354, 323, 504, 506, I.P.C., P.S. Gosainganj, District Lucknow, on his furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of Magistrate/Court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
8.

